// Ch8 B05, tier 3's seized flue-key and the mark behind it (act1_ch08.md §2 B05; F05 → F04, in place,
// no letterbox). The party can't turn the key; Liss can (Ch08CoilspireZone plays this the first time
// anyone tries it, then the key turns). Then the mark (F04, macro): behind the freed key, scratched
// into the stone where nobody would look, fine parallel lines and node-dots, the same grammar as the
// marks on Liss's arm, in an old style no living wright uses, closed by a small key-shaped glyph. Liss
// goes still and takes a charcoal rubbing onto her wrist. Rhen is the only one who sees.
// Rhen keeps Liss's secret while keeping his own (his stopped "My—" pays off in Ch11). She doesn't know
// whose mark it is (Wenna's; vowbound.md §3). Sets ch08_liss_found_marks (critical path).
title: ch08_stuck_key
location: ch08/coilspire
---
@camera F05_t3
@anim toma strain_key seized_key
@wait 1.0
@mark liss seized_key_liss walk
Liss [determined]: Don't. Don't force her. #line:ch08_stuck_key_001
@anim liss ease_key seized_key
@sfx flue_key_free
@wait 1.2
Liss [soft_smile]: ...There. She wants oil, not muscle. #line:ch08_stuck_key_002
@camera F04
@face liss neutral 0.2
@wait 1.5
@mark rhen seized_key_rhen walk
Liss [neutral]: Somebody seated this. A wright. In a temple. #line:ch08_stuck_key_003 #whisper
Rhen [neutral]: I've seen marks like that on salvage. My— #line:ch08_stuck_key_004 #whisper
@wait 0.8
Liss [neutral]: Your what? #line:ch08_stuck_key_005 #whisper
Rhen [neutral]: Nothing. Salvage. #line:ch08_stuck_key_006 #whisper
@anim liss charcoal_rubbing
@wait 1.5
Liss [cold]: Don't tell them. #line:ch08_stuck_key_007 #whisper
Rhen [neutral]: Wasn't going to. #line:ch08_stuck_key_008 #whisper
<<set $ch08_liss_found_marks = true>>
@camera F05_t3
===
